# Build output
bin/*
obj/
# ...except the COM interop wrapper for the Windows "UPnP 1.0 Type Library"
# (used by UpnpControlPoint.vb for router port-forwarding). It's a generated
# 15 KB shim over a built-in Windows component — committed so a cloud build
# (GitHub Actions) can resolve the reference without regenerating it.
!bin/Interop.UPNPLib.dll

# Visual Studio per-user
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

*.cmd
# claude (agent worktrees, local config) — never publish
.claude/
